      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK are delighted to welcome you to 11 Edenbrook Close, a beautifully presented four bedroom semi-detached residence ideally positioned in the heart of Citywest, Dublin 24. Extending to approximately 154 sq.m., this impressive A-rated home offers spacious, energy-efficient living in a highly sought-after and family-friendly development. \r\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a warm and inviting entrance hallway with generous built-in storage, setting the tone for the well-designed accommodation throughout. To one side lies a bright dual-aspect living room, filled with natural light and featuring double doors that open directly onto the large rear garden—perfect for both relaxing evenings and entertaining guests. On the opposite side of the hallway is a contemporary dual-aspect kitchen and dining room, thoughtfully laid out with ample cabinetry and workspace and has double doors leading to the rear garden. A separate utility room provides additional storage and convenience. The ground floor is further complemented \r\nby a stylish guest WC. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the first floor hosts four spacious bedrooms, all offering excellent storage. The master bedroom is particularly impressive, complete with a modern ensuite bathroom. \r\nA well-appointed family bathroom and additional storage complete the upper level, ensuring practicality for growing families. \r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking for two vehicles to the front. To the rear, a notably spacious garden provides a wonderful outdoor retreat, ideal for children at play, gardening enthusiasts, or al fresco dining during the warmer months. \r\n\r\n11 Edenbrook Close enjoys an enviable location within Citywest, a thriving and well connected suburb of Dublin. The area is superbly served by local amenities including Citywest Shopping Centre, a range of supermarkets, cafés, and restaurants. Families are well catered for with a choice of primary and secondary schools nearby, as well as \r\nexcellent childcare facilities. Leisure amenities abound, with parks, playgrounds, and golf clubs within easy reach, including the renowned Citywest Hotel & Golf Club. The property is within walking distance of the Citywest LUAS stop, providing swift access to Dublin city centre, while the nearby N7 and M50 road networks ensure excellent connectivity to all major routes. \r\n\r\nCombining generous proportions, modern energy efficiency, and a prime location close to every convenience, 11 Edenbrook Close presents a superb opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in one of Dublin’s most popular residential areas. \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
